window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"Your curse is your biggest strength. </p> <p><i>I just didn't know it yet.</i> </p> <p>When Jamie and Gabrielle ran away in the middle of the night, they thought they'd be leaving their troubles behind them. Now, they're starting to realize those troubles have just begun. </p> <p>With no money, no plan, and no destination, they find themselves the world's most wanted fugitives - trying to stay one step ahead of an international intelligence organization tasked with hunting them down. An intelligence organization run by Jamie's own father. </p> <p>An opportunity presents itself, but nothing is as it seems. Alliances are strained. Powers are tested. And no one knows who to trust. </p> <p>How do you outrun your destiny? </p> <p>Never give up. Never give in. </p> <p><b>Mending Magic Series: </b><br> <b><i>Lost Souls </i></b><i><br> </i><b><i>Illusion of Power </i></b><i><br> </i><b><i>Challenging the Dark</i></b></p>"; 
